# Enclave staging artifacts, produced by `make enclave-stage` and shipped in the
# `make enclave-bundle` tarball rather than committed. vendor/ is generated the
# same way: keeping it out of the repo means plugins that never build for an
# enclave carry no cost, and there is no vendor tree to drift from go.mod.
build/enclave/
/vendor/

